in ke Papan Klip!','Import Editor Settings'=>'Impor Pengaturan Editor','Paste the editor data from the "Export" tab on another site.'=>'Tempel data editor dari tab "Ekspor" di situs lain.','Invalid data'=>'Data tidak valid','Settings Imported Successfully!'=>'Pengaturan Berhasil Diimpor!','Import Data'=>'Impor Data','How to generate and use a theme template file'=>'Cara menghasilkan dan menggunakan file template tema','Click the "Generate Template" button under the text area. Wait for the code to be generated.'=>'Klik tombol "Hasilkan Template" di bawah area teks. Tunggu hingga kode dihasilkan.','Create an empty php template file with your desired file slug in the %1$s /publishpress-authors/author-boxes/ %2$s folder of your theme. %3$s For example, the file can be located here: %4$s /wp-content/themes/%5$syour-theme-name%6$s/publishpress-authors/author-boxes/my-first-custom-author-template.php %7$s .'=>'Buat file template php kosong dengan slug file yang Anda inginkan di folder %1$s /publishpress-authors/author-boxes/ %2$s tema Anda. %3$s Misalnya, file dapat terletak di sini: %4$s /wp-content/themes/%5$snama-tema-anda%6$s/publishpress-authors/author-boxes/my-first-custom-author-template.php %7$s .','Copy the generated code and paste it inside the newly created file.'=>'Salin kode yang dihasilkan dan tempelkan di dalam file yang baru dibuat.','Congratulations. Your can now choose your template inside the PublishPress Authors Settings.'=>'Selamat. Anda sekarang dapat memilih template Anda di dalam Pengaturan PublishPress Authors.','You can read more information on the %s.'=>'Anda dapat membaca lebih banyak informasi di %s.','documentation page'=>'halaman dokumentasi','Generate Template'=>'Hasilkan Template','Template generated successfuly!'=>'Template berhasil dihasilkan!','Reorder Fields'=>'Susun Ulang Bidang','Reorder the fields by dragging them to the correct position and saving your changes.'=>'Susun ulang bidang dengan menyeretnya ke posisi yang benar dan menyim